Motor Vehicle Rental Management System

1. System Scope

System Name

27860_2024 Hassan Vehicle Rental Management System

## Purpose

The system automates the process of renting vehicles by managing customers, vehicles, rentals, payments, vehicle returns, penalties, maintenance, users, and reports.

## Included Modules

* Customer Management
* Vehicle Management
* Rental Management
* Payment Management
* Return Record Management
* Fine/Penalty Management
* Maintenance Management
* User Management
* Reporting

## Outside the System

* Bank
* Insurance Company
* Government Transport Authority

